        strSql += vbCrLf + "  /*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~PURE MAKING CHARGES TRANSACTIONS~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~*/"
