        strSql += vbCrLf + " 	SELECT @QRY ='IF (SELECT TOP 1 1 FROM TEMPTABLEDB..SYSOBJECTS WHERE NAME = ''TEMPCASHBOOK'')>0 DROP TABLE TEMPTABLEDB..TEMPCASHBOOK'"
