        strSql += vbCrLf + " 	SELECT @QRY=@QRY+ char(13)+ ' + ISNULL(CASE WHEN '''+@ORDERBY+''' =''G'' AND PAYMODE IN(''SA'',''PU'',''SR'',''SV'',''PV'',''RV'') THEN '' TO '' + CONVERT (VARCHAR(20),(SELECT MAX(TRANNO) FROM TEMPTABLEDB..TEMPPOSDETAIL WHERE PAYMODE=T.PAYMODE AND ACCODE=T.ACCODE AND TRANDATE=T.TRANDATE ) ) +'' )'' END,'''')' "
        strSql += vbCrLf + " 	SELECT @QRY=@QRY+ char(13)+ ' + CASE WHEN '''+@ORDERBY+'''=''G'' AND PAYMODE in(''MR'',''AR'',''DR'',''OR'',''MP'',''AP'',''DP'',''AA'') AND T.REMARK1 <>'''' THEN CHAR(13) + ''(''+ T.REMARK1 +'')'' ELSE '''' END'"
        strSql += vbCrLf + " 	SELECT @QRY=@QRY+ char(13)+ ' + CASE WHEN '''+@ORDERBY+'''=''G'' AND PAYMODE in(''MR'',''AR'',''DR'',''OR'',''MP'',''AP'',''DP'',''AA'') AND T.REMARK2 <>'''' THEN '' '' + ''(''+ T.REMARK2 +'')'' ELSE '''' END'"
        strSql += vbCrLf + " 	SELECT @QRY=@QRY+ char(13)+ ' AS ACNAME,DEBIT,CREDIT,GRSWT,T.ACCODE,PAYMODE,REFNO,REFDATE,CHQCARDNO,CHQDATE FROM TEMPTABLEDB..TEMPPOSDETAIL AS T'"
