        strSql += vbCrLf + "  		SELECT @QRY= @QRY + ' FROM TEMPTABLEDB..TEMPITEMNONTAG WHERE RECDATE BETWEEN '''+@FROMDATE+''' AND '''+@TODATE+''' AND RECISS = ''R'''"
